# Data Layer

- JSON shapes defined in `lib/types.ts` and documented in `docs/DATA-MODEL.md`
- Read data only via `lib/getData.ts` — components never `import x from "@/data/..."`
- Field names must match future CMS API shape (ADR 002)
- Placeholder brand: `"Premium UPVC"`
- Validate with Zod in `lib/schemas.ts` when schemas exist

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD
const windows = getWindows();

// ❌ BAD
import windows from "@/data/windows.json";
```
